---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="relative py-20 lg:py-28">
            <div class="garna-container">
                <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl font-normal leading-tight text-white lg:text-5xl font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.title">
                        Trusted by Growing Small Businesses
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 min-[961px]:grid-cols-3">
                    <article class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] p-6 text-left" style="--delay: 60ms">
                        <div class="flex h-[4.75rem] items-start gap-4">
                            <div class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-[#CBF300]/30 bg-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[0_0_32px_-16px_rgba(203, 243, 0,0.9)]">
                                <img src="/pages/payroll-small-business/assets/testimonial-emma-v2.jpg" alt="Emma Torres" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="min-w-0 pt-1">
                                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white font-manrope">Emma Torres</h3>
                                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-5 text-gray-500 font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.emma.role">Founder, Loomline Studio</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400 md:mt-4" data-translate="testimonials.emma.quote">
                            "We hired our first full-time designer abroad without opening an entity. Garna handled the contract, local payroll, and monthly documents while we stayed focused on clients"
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] p-6 text-left" style="--delay: 120ms">
                        <div class="flex h-[4.75rem] items-start gap-4">
                            <div class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-[#6BAED6]/30 bg-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[0_0_32px_-16px_rgba(107,174,214,0.9)]">
                                <img src="/pages/payroll-small-business/assets/testimonial-michael-v2.jpg" alt="Michael Chen" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="min-w-0 pt-1">
                                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white font-manrope">Michael Chen</h3>
                                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-5 text-gray-500 font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.michael.role">Operations Lead, BrightCart</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400 md:mt-4" data-translate="testimonials.michael.quote">
                            "Contractor payouts stopped taking over our Fridays. The team receives money on time, invoices are generated automatically, and finance has a clean record of every payment"
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] p-6 text-left" style="--delay: 180ms">
                        <div class="flex h-[4.75rem] items-start gap-4">
                            <div class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[0_0_32px_-16px_rgba(255,255,255,0.55)]">
                                <img src="/pages/payroll-small-business/assets/testimonial-sofia-v2.jpg" alt="Sofia Marin" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="min-w-0 pt-1">
                                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white font-manrope">Sofia Marin</h3>
                                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-5 text-gray-500 font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.sofia.role">People Partner, Northstar Analytics</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400 md:mt-4" data-translate="testimonials.sofia.quote">
                            "As our team grew across five countries, Garna gave us one payroll flow for employees and contractors. Support answers fast and keeps every local detail under control"
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </Section>
